== F  what the data DO force: Markov lower bound c >= X^2 (1 - mu(X))
   best-fit RAR-nu: max_X X^2 (1-mu(X)) = 4.88 at X = 15.1  (c = 25.98)
   standard mu_2:  max_X X^2 (1-mu(X)) = 0.50  (its tail x^-2/2 saturates at 1/2 x-independent: c >= 0.5 per e-fold)
PASS F1 the Markov bound from the best-fit shape is ~4-5 (X^2 (1-mu) at X ~ 10-20): the shape SPARC prefers forces c >= 4.6 and nothing more; the requirement is 61-100

